<title>FRANCE: France revises up winter rapeseed estimate.</title>
<headline>France revises up winter rapeseed estimate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's farm ministry said on Wednesday it had revised up its estimate for winter rapeseed sowings to 931,000 hectares from a previous estimate of 909,000 hectares.</p>
<p>The new estimate brings sowings for the winter rapeseed crop to a level 8.3 percent above last year's sowings across 860,000 hectares, the ministry's SCEES statistical office said.</p>
<p>It had previously projected a 6.1 percent increase.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
